                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6ab05ba-9450-4e78-bab1-c71193fc75a8",
                                "sense_id": "446ac493-86cc-3840-b532-b61cf8efa227",
                                "text": "GUY: I've always worn jammies. Don't think I'd feel right without 'em.\n SAM [Tosses pajamas to Guy L.]: Then you wear them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "459b0bff-c77e-4959-927a-d25be1eb9434",
                                "sense_id": "446ac493-86cc-3840-b532-b61cf8efa227",
                                "text": "I was just in my pajamas and slippers, and I blushed because she was looking at me. Then she whispered, \"Take off your jammies, and love me up good, Arlene. Please, I want you to.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "82db3a49-9234-417e-8e49-851f13ec98f3",
                                "sense_id": "446ac493-86cc-3840-b532-b61cf8efa227",
                                "text": "Took her a sec to come to the door; but she did, eventually. In jammies. Like she'd stayed in, couldn't sleep, and got hungry."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
